  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with imagenet_vit_l image encoder and weighted fusion achieves high accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests the impact of switching to resnet50 image encoder and avgpool aggregation while keeping scvi_n200 RNA and weighted fusion. It isolates the effect of image encoder and aggregation method, which are critical factors, and could reveal if simpler components (resnet50/avgpool) outperform complex ones (imagenet_vit_l/transformer) in this context."
}

